# Allium specifications

- After creating or editing `.allium` files, run `allium check <path>` and fix diagnostics. Use `allium analyse` when exploring cross-rule implications.
- Specs describe **observable behaviour** (entities, rules, transitions). Do not encode incidental implementation choices (schemas, frameworks) unless they are part of the contract.
- Prefer JUXT Allium slash skills (`/allium`, `/allium:elicit`, `/allium:distill`, `/allium:tend`, `/allium:weed`) instead of duplicating language-reference prose in chat.
- Cursor lacks Claude Code PostToolUse hooks — validation is manual or via editor LSP ([allium-tools](https://github.com/juxt/allium-tools)).
